WEBVTT

00:00:15.974 --> 00:00:18.744
Do you really think this is safe?

00:00:19.214 --> 00:00:22.654
I hope they aren't just going to take us prisoner!

00:00:24.554 --> 00:00:27.154
Calling for talks out of the blue...

00:00:27.154 --> 00:00:31.254
With no preliminary agreements or anything!

00:00:31.794 --> 00:00:34.994
What do they mean by "peace talks", anyway?

00:00:34.994 --> 00:00:38.724
Why not just say "unconditional surrender"?

00:00:39.974 --> 00:00:42.704
Who knows what they're plotting...

00:00:43.974 --> 00:00:45.874
That's a pretty pessimistic attitude.

00:00:46.104 --> 00:00:53.354
Well, of course! They're not like us, you know!

00:00:53.354 --> 00:00:55.404
Don't worry.

00:00:58.384 --> 00:01:02.054
"No matter what blade thou might posses,
thou shalt not cut...

00:01:02.354 --> 00:01:06.224
The rose that blooms in the
wilderness that is my home."

00:01:09.334 --> 00:01:11.764
What's that?

00:01:11.904 --> 00:01:13.734
A prayer for luck.

00:01:16.404 --> 00:01:17.634
Don't worry.

00:01:21.874 --> 00:01:23.844
Everything will be all right.

00:01:27.554 --> 00:01:29.144
I'm sure of it.

00:01:35.294 --> 00:01:38.084
That which bears water.

00:02:03.824 --> 00:02:05.684
Listen to me, Mari.

00:02:06.284 --> 00:02:14.024
You need friends... friends you can laugh
and cry with. True companions!

00:02:14.394 --> 00:02:15.764
But grandmother!

00:02:15.764 --> 00:02:19.594
If you're worried about my studies,
I'm doing just fine...

00:02:19.734 --> 00:02:25.804
No, dear. There are some things
no tutor can teach.

00:02:27.714 --> 00:02:33.204
I know you might not understand that yet.

00:02:36.514 --> 00:02:42.184
I'm sure this is what your
parents would have wanted.

00:02:58.374 --> 00:03:00.434
In other words...

00:03:00.714 --> 00:03:02.834
She just wanted to get rid of me!

00:03:51.524 --> 00:03:52.854
Wow!

00:04:32.964 --> 00:04:34.734
Hey, did you see that?

00:04:35.204 --> 00:04:36.964
Did I see what?

00:04:50.684 --> 00:04:51.944
Yes...

00:04:52.584 --> 00:04:54.254
That's her.

00:05:12.974 --> 00:05:14.634
Thank you for waiting.

00:05:14.974 --> 00:05:17.274
It's just a bit further.

00:05:18.414 --> 00:05:19.714
This town...

00:05:21.714 --> 00:05:24.244
It sure is run-down, isn't it?

00:05:24.524 --> 00:05:30.684
Well, yes. I hear it used to have
quite a shipping industry, though.

00:05:45.874 --> 00:05:46.744
Kaio Academy

00:05:46.744 --> 00:05:49.414
Kaio Academy
Welcome to the Kaio Academy!

00:05:49.414 --> 00:05:50.344
Kaio Academy

00:05:51.344 --> 00:05:53.614
I'm Headmaster Fukamachi.

00:05:54.114 --> 00:05:58.114
And I'm Director Maiyama. How do you do?

00:06:00.954 --> 00:06:02.324
Mistress Mari...

00:06:02.794 --> 00:06:05.594
I'm Mari Wakatake.

00:06:07.934 --> 00:06:11.694
Er, pardon me.

00:06:12.364 --> 00:06:16.894
I have the young lady's enrollment
application and other documents.

00:06:17.144 --> 00:06:18.534
Thank you.

00:06:20.444 --> 00:06:22.274
Hmm...

00:06:22.974 --> 00:06:23.744
Student Information
May 20, 1999
Mari wakatake
Born May 27, 1982 -Age 16 - Kamioki
Komatsu Yamamoto - Grandmother - Dec 18, 1929
Lost both parents in 1999 Kamioka Island Disaster,
retains no memory of

00:06:23.744 --> 00:06:24.284
Student Information
May 20, 1999
Mari wakatake
Born May 27, 1982 -Age 16 - Kamioki
Komatsu Yamamoto - Grandmother - Dec 18, 1929
Lost both parents in 1999 Kamioka Island Disaster,
retains no memory of
Now, listen well, Miss Wakatake...

00:06:24.284 --> 00:06:26.474
Now, listen well, Miss Wakatake...

00:06:26.784 --> 00:06:30.554
Under the motto of "discipline,
self-control, and morality,"

00:06:30.554 --> 00:06:35.684
this is an institution of impeccable repute, with a
century of tradition.

00:06:35.924 --> 00:06:40.264
From this day forward, you will comport
yourself with the dignity and decorum

00:06:40.264 --> 00:06:43.664
befitting a student of the Kaio Academy...

00:06:43.664 --> 00:06:45.034
Miss Wakatake!

00:06:45.034 --> 00:06:48.764
I expect you to listen when I
address you, young lady!

00:06:50.774 --> 00:06:52.004
Sorry.

00:06:52.004 --> 00:06:54.404
Why, you insolent little...

00:06:54.944 --> 00:07:00.434
I understand you've never
attended school before?

00:07:02.184 --> 00:07:03.444
Yes.

00:07:04.324 --> 00:07:06.084
No wonder.

00:07:15.264 --> 00:07:18.824
Unfortunately, the students are
all away on holiday today...

00:07:22.074 --> 00:07:23.564
You there!

00:07:24.644 --> 00:07:28.944
Pardon me, but would you mind
showing around a new student?

00:07:30.384 --> 00:07:31.844
Me?

00:07:37.254 --> 00:07:40.224
It'll take some time to take
care of your paperwork.

00:07:40.624 --> 00:07:43.754
Until then, why don't you have
a look around campus?

00:07:52.804 --> 00:07:55.104
Sorry I'm late!

00:07:59.874 --> 00:08:04.174
I'm Yuko Sugawara. Nice to meet you!

00:08:04.744 --> 00:08:07.684
What was that? Since when does
a lady enter without knocking?

00:08:07.814 --> 00:08:12.344
Allow me to introduce you. Miss Wakatake,
meet your new homeroom teacher...

00:08:12.454 --> 00:08:18.324
Yuko Sugawara. Oh... I already said that,
didn't I? Glad to meet you, Miss Wakamachi!

00:08:21.094 --> 00:08:23.324
It's Wakatake.

00:08:23.534 --> 00:08:26.094
Oh, yes, Wakatake!

00:08:27.174 --> 00:08:32.204
Miss Sugawara! I realize you're still
learning the ropes here,

00:08:32.204 --> 00:08:36.474
but your decorum as a homeroom teacher
is lacking, to say the least!

00:08:37.074 --> 00:08:42.544
Miss Maiyama, could we discuss this when
we're not in the presence of students?

00:08:42.914 --> 00:08:45.354
Students?

00:08:46.784 --> 00:08:55.324
Er, I knocked... but I guess nobody heard.
I'm sorry!

00:08:58.834 --> 00:09:03.704
With the junior and senior high schools put
together, there are about 400 students.

00:09:04.274 --> 00:09:09.574
As I'm sure you will too,
almost all of them live in the dorms.

00:09:10.714 --> 00:09:12.874
Um, Miss Wakatake?

00:09:13.344 --> 00:09:14.814
Wait up!

00:09:15.514 --> 00:09:17.414
Don't mind me...

00:09:18.054 --> 00:09:25.354
Kozuki. Michiko Kozuki.
We're going to be classmates!

00:09:26.624 --> 00:09:30.584
Well then, Miss Kozuki, thank you
for showing me around.

00:09:30.904 --> 00:09:36.064
But I don't intend to stay,
so there's really no need.

00:09:36.634 --> 00:09:41.474
You're not staying? But I thought
you were enrolling here...

00:09:42.014 --> 00:09:46.204
Yes... I was living with my grandmother...

00:09:47.014 --> 00:09:49.244
But I guess she didn't want me around anymore!

00:09:56.354 --> 00:10:02.354
Mistress Mari is the Madam's granddaughter.

00:10:02.734 --> 00:10:08.864
When she was younger, she was such
a cheerful, vibrant child...

00:10:10.374 --> 00:10:14.304
But that was before the incident
that took place five years ago.

00:10:16.744 --> 00:10:20.774
Yes... I'll run away! Just wait!

00:10:34.364 --> 00:10:37.334
Then, her grandmother's ill?

00:10:38.004 --> 00:10:42.074
She's been careful to hide it from Mistress Mari,

00:10:42.074 --> 00:10:46.094
but her health has been
declining for several years.

00:10:47.844 --> 00:10:50.504
She may not have long left.

00:10:52.114 --> 00:10:57.084
The Madam is terribly concerned
about Mari's future.

00:10:57.084 --> 00:11:00.614
That's why she asked that she be enrolled here.

00:11:01.824 --> 00:11:04.754
I'll run away! I'll run away...

00:11:12.934 --> 00:11:16.994
But where will I go?

00:11:18.504 --> 00:11:21.964
Cherry Blossoms 11th Grade

00:11:36.394 --> 00:11:40.124
Where do I want to go?

00:11:40.994 --> 00:11:42.434
Um...

00:11:44.734 --> 00:11:47.394
This is our classroom.

00:11:48.004 --> 00:11:51.664
Of course, there's nobody here now.

00:11:52.744 --> 00:11:54.174
Oh.

00:11:59.344 --> 00:12:02.714
I've had her belongings brought
into the dormitory.

00:12:02.714 --> 00:12:04.484
Yes, Ma'am.

00:12:04.784 --> 00:12:06.984
I'll be going, then.

00:12:22.204 --> 00:12:23.504
Miss Kozuki.

00:12:23.504 --> 00:12:25.094
Y-yes!

00:12:25.244 --> 00:12:28.314
You're in the Blue Sea Dorm too, aren't you?

00:12:28.314 --> 00:12:29.374
Yes!

00:12:29.374 --> 00:12:35.244
Very good. Please be so kind as
to show Miss Wakatake around.

00:12:36.684 --> 00:12:38.084
Yes, Ma'am.

00:12:48.164 --> 00:12:49.934
Amnesia?

00:12:49.934 --> 00:12:53.064
Yes. Ever since the disaster five years ago.

00:12:53.064 --> 00:12:56.194
She's forgotten her parents and
everything about the incident.

00:12:56.674 --> 00:13:01.904
We'll have to exercise the
utmost of care with her.

00:13:03.344 --> 00:13:06.314
Yes, of course.

00:13:06.584 --> 00:13:11.484
The board of directors certainly has a
great deal of faith in you, Miss Sugawara.

00:13:12.554 --> 00:13:14.824
Well, don't forget,

00:13:14.824 --> 00:13:17.254
I do have a degree in counseling, you know!

00:13:22.494 --> 00:13:23.864
This is it.

00:13:28.934 --> 00:13:31.904
Blue Sea Dorm

00:13:32.204 --> 00:13:35.374
There's nobody here, since it's a holiday.

00:13:35.814 --> 00:13:39.474
I'll introduce you to everyone at dinner.

00:13:49.824 --> 00:13:51.724
This is going to be your room.

00:13:52.224 --> 00:13:57.664
They thought you'd be more comfortable in a
single until you get used to it here...

00:13:58.904 --> 00:14:02.494
I'll be right back with the Dorm Chief.

00:14:20.054 --> 00:14:21.384
Hmph!

00:14:27.394 --> 00:14:28.724
Miss Kozuki?

00:14:29.764 --> 00:14:30.994
Oh, no!

00:14:31.264 --> 00:14:33.134
You've arrived?

00:14:39.404 --> 00:14:41.104
Why, hello!

00:14:41.744 --> 00:14:44.304
So you're a student here, too?

00:14:44.644 --> 00:14:47.914
I'm Mari Wakatake. Nice to meet you!

00:14:48.684 --> 00:14:50.844
I'm Hagino Senkoji.

00:14:50.954 --> 00:14:51.924
Pleased to meet you.

00:15:08.974 --> 00:15:11.374
Hey, I saw you a little while ago...

00:15:14.974 --> 00:15:17.104
There sure were...

00:15:17.374 --> 00:15:19.244
a lot of birds...

00:15:21.414 --> 00:15:22.854
Um...

00:15:30.254 --> 00:15:31.884
I can't breathe!

00:15:58.024 --> 00:16:02.154
What the heck was that for?!

00:16:12.064 --> 00:16:15.464
Well? Answer me!

00:16:27.614 --> 00:16:30.084
Hagino? Are you in there?

00:16:31.424 --> 00:16:33.414
Here she is.

00:16:34.494 --> 00:16:36.924
I'm Funatsumaru, your dorm chief!

00:16:37.524 --> 00:16:39.654
Chief in name only, of course...

00:16:39.994 --> 00:16:41.554
Huh?

00:16:42.434 --> 00:16:44.664
Did something... happen?

00:16:44.734 --> 00:16:46.464
Miss Wakatake?

00:16:50.874 --> 00:16:52.434
Hey, you!

00:16:52.974 --> 00:16:54.604
Where are you going?

00:16:55.014 --> 00:16:59.104
You expect me to stay in a place like this?

00:17:00.884 --> 00:17:02.144
Miss Wakatake!

00:17:02.954 --> 00:17:04.924
What's with her?

00:17:05.054 --> 00:17:07.614
Did something happen?

00:17:08.324 --> 00:17:09.684
No.

00:17:10.124 --> 00:17:13.784
She's probably just tired.

00:17:15.534 --> 00:17:18.364
I hope that's all it is...

00:17:32.844 --> 00:17:34.904
What's her problem?!

00:17:37.784 --> 00:17:39.774
She must be insane!

00:17:42.754 --> 00:17:44.154
But...

00:17:46.664 --> 00:17:47.934
What was that?

00:17:47.934 --> 00:17:49.424
Miss Wakatake!

00:17:54.434 --> 00:17:56.804
I'm so glad I found you!

00:18:02.444 --> 00:18:04.744
It really is a huge school.

00:18:05.684 --> 00:18:09.054
There are twelve dorms all together.

00:18:09.054 --> 00:18:12.554
Everything's so elegant, it's hard to believe,

00:18:12.554 --> 00:18:16.254
and all of the girls come
from such wealthy families!

00:18:16.854 --> 00:18:19.584
The quintessential exclusive
boarding school, you might say...

00:18:26.704 --> 00:18:29.764
I was born in this town.

00:18:31.304 --> 00:18:34.364
I took the entrance exam expecting
to fail, but I passed!

00:18:35.874 --> 00:18:42.014
My parents are just shopkeepers, so I told
them it was okay if we couldn't afford it.

00:18:42.514 --> 00:18:48.184
But my dad got all gung-ho, saying he'd sell
the house to have me attend Kaio!

00:18:49.894 --> 00:18:53.724
But nobody else here comes from
a family like mine...

00:18:54.564 --> 00:18:58.764
I can't help feeling self-conscious about it.

00:19:03.734 --> 00:19:05.704
Sounds like a nice dad!

00:19:07.644 --> 00:19:09.044
Yes!

00:19:10.814 --> 00:19:14.274
But the people here are all really nice, too!

00:19:14.954 --> 00:19:21.214
Those flowers in your room... Miss Senkoji
put them there, to welcome you.

00:19:21.554 --> 00:19:24.254
Senkoji? That girl back there?

00:19:24.324 --> 00:19:29.524
Yes. Hagino Senkoji! She's terribly smart!

00:19:29.664 --> 00:19:32.964
She's a great student, and an
amazing athlete, too!

00:19:33.434 --> 00:19:35.924
Oh? Is that so.

00:19:36.574 --> 00:19:38.694
Um, Miss Wakatake?

00:19:39.044 --> 00:19:43.504
I'm not sure what happened between you,

00:19:43.914 --> 00:19:47.144
but I'm sure there was some
sort of misunderstanding!

00:19:47.244 --> 00:19:49.554
Once it's cleared up,

00:19:49.554 --> 00:19:56.354
I'm sure... I'm sure you'll really
like Miss Senkoji, too!

00:20:02.634 --> 00:20:04.184
Yeah, great.

00:20:07.604 --> 00:20:10.234
I-I'm sorry! Going on and on about myself!

00:20:11.004 --> 00:20:12.474
No...

00:20:12.874 --> 00:20:15.034
It's fine. Let's head back.

00:20:17.174 --> 00:20:19.014
Okay!

00:20:20.744 --> 00:20:22.514
By the way...

00:20:23.514 --> 00:20:26.074
What did you say your name was?

00:20:26.154 --> 00:20:27.884
Huh?

00:20:31.294 --> 00:20:38.294
As all of you know, today we have
a new friend in our dormitory.

00:20:39.164 --> 00:20:41.224
Her name is Mari Wakatake!

00:20:41.404 --> 00:20:42.924
Nice to meet you.

00:20:48.144 --> 00:20:50.014
If you have any questions,

00:20:50.014 --> 00:20:52.244
you can ask me, Hiroko Funatsumaru,

00:20:52.244 --> 00:20:56.704
or my deputy Dorm Chief, Hagino Senkoji!

00:21:00.724 --> 00:21:02.584
Once again, welcome.

00:21:04.094 --> 00:21:05.924
Yeah, right!

00:21:08.794 --> 00:21:10.624
Like I'd shake your hand!

00:21:12.004 --> 00:21:13.134
What was that about?

00:21:13.134 --> 00:21:14.794
Don't play dumb with me!

00:21:18.974 --> 00:21:19.744
Lady Hagino!

00:21:19.744 --> 00:21:20.774
How dare you!

00:21:20.774 --> 00:21:22.174
Why, you little...

00:21:30.884 --> 00:21:32.854
Um, everyone?

00:21:33.584 --> 00:21:34.824
Hmm...

00:21:34.824 --> 00:21:37.584
That new girl's pretty tough!

00:21:41.364 --> 00:21:43.594
Take that!

00:21:46.504 --> 00:21:48.334
That's enough!

00:21:52.874 --> 00:21:55.174
You girls who were fighting... no dinner!

00:21:55.844 --> 00:21:57.774
Now go to your rooms!

00:22:07.724 --> 00:22:09.714
I'm starving...

00:22:18.364 --> 00:22:19.834
Hmm?

00:22:29.314 --> 00:22:30.644
I knew it!

00:22:38.484 --> 00:22:39.784
Huh?

00:22:40.124 --> 00:22:41.984
I'm sure I saw her...

00:22:44.054 --> 00:22:45.584
There!

00:22:45.994 --> 00:22:47.794
What's she doing?!

00:23:38.644 --> 00:23:47.184
A ship laden with sorrows

00:23:49.154 --> 00:23:59.364
Loudly singing its song of ruin

00:24:04.174 --> 00:24:08.704
From the blackest depths

00:24:10.144 --> 00:24:15.244
It rises to the surface

00:24:19.224 --> 00:24:30.354
Oh! You and I! We stretch our white wings now!

00:24:31.164 --> 00:24:42.114
Flying off into the vast sky

00:24:42.114 --> 00:24:56.284
We dream of that day, dream of that day

00:25:02.134 --> 00:25:06.824
Mari Wakatake's new life at the
Kaio Academy begins,

00:25:08.234 --> 00:25:12.294
and she is reacquainted with Hagino Senkoji.

00:25:13.204 --> 00:25:16.804
Memories surface from the
terrifying abyss of the past,

00:25:17.214 --> 00:25:22.204
and Mari sees something
unbelievable behind Hagino.

00:25:24.354 --> 00:25:28.654
Next time on Blue Drop: Lavandula.
